# The bootstrap seed and the POSIX build scripts must keep LF endings regardless of
# core.autocrlf. A CRLF checkout of a shell script fails on macOS with an opaque
# "bad interpreter" error, and the seed is a build input that should be byte-stable
# across platforms so its hash means the same thing everywhere.
bootstrap/prismio-seed.ll text eol=lf
*.sh                      text eol=lf
